		{
			dependencies: ["2CE1981212E382B1"]
			description: [
				"You beat your own shadow. Word travels, and older things than the Cataclysm lords have heard it."
				""
				"&6The Sleepless&f - champions and kings who refuse to stay dead, and the two halves of the day itself."
				"&cThe Qliphoth&f - three fallen judges, under the earth, under the sea and among the End cities."
				"&4The Dark Court&f - the Nether cult, its necromancers, the End's black knight and the Apostle."
				"&3Below the Bedrock&f - the Warden's heart opens a world under the world."
				"&dChaos&f - a dragon that was never killed, far out in the End."
				""
				"Every line can be taken in any order. Bring friends: none of this was made to be fought alone."
			]
